---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="How we pick" description={`How ${SITE.name} chooses and verifies every business it lists.`}>
  <div class="narrow stack prose" style="padding:32px 16px">
    <h1>How we pick and verify</h1>
    <p>[Your editorial policy. Cover: how businesses get considered, whether you visit or call each one, what you check (hours, licenses for trades, prices), how often lists are re-checked, and how you handle corrections.]</p>
    <h2>Verification dates</h2>
    <p>Every listing shows the month its details were last checked. If something has changed, <a href="/contact/">tell us</a> and we'll update it.</p>
    <h2>Money</h2>
    <p>[Explain clearly how the site makes money, e.g. clearly labeled featured placements, and that rankings are never for sale.]</p>
  </div>
</Base>
